<title>GREECE: Delta Inform OKs 1.5bln drs rights issue.</title>
<headline>Delta Inform OKs 1.5bln drs rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's Delta Informatics got shareholder approval for a 1.5 billion drachma rights issue on Monday.</p>
<p>Delta Informatics will issue 500,000 new common registered shares with a par value of 300 drachmas at 3,000 drachmas each. The terms will be one new share per nine outstanding.</p>
<p>The ex-rights date was set for June 9 and rights would be traded between June 9 and July 11. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
